    "message": "Keep a case's criteria as the capturer gives them\n\nThe capturer writes a case's criteria, so Linewright receives them rather\nthan produces them, and Secrets now redacts only what Linewright and its\nsessions produce. case::capture no longer takes a Redaction, `lw capture`\nno longer builds the secrets it only needed for that, and the redaction\nmodule's doc states the new scope.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
